codex
The failure is caused by the audit sandbox denying each process access to `/proc/<its-own-pid>/exe`; Lean 4.22 hard-codes that lookup, so even `lean --version` fails before reading project code. I found a narrow workaround: a local preload shim that substitutes only this self-executable lookup from the process’s own invocation path. I’ll test it against the pinned binaries, document it as audit infrastructure, and then rerun the unmodified trusted preflight.
